{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"13bc0467-553a-4018-aa14-43fc84fb38df","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have completed the read-only checkup against your MCP server following the guide. The server code was not modified, only safe read-only operations were executed, and the findings have been written to [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-Zq6b6Z/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Findings\n\n- **Overall verdict:** **has the problem**\n- **C1 (Tool list answers without token):** **PASS** — `initialize`, `tools/list` (3 tools), and `server/discover` all respond appropriately without requiring credentials.\n- **C2 (Tool refusal protocol):** **FAIL** — Tool refusals (non-existent id `n-999` and missing required parameters) return JSON-RPC `-32602` error responses instead of `isError: true` tool execution results.\n- **C3 (Session survives error):** **PASS** — Following the error, subsequent tool calls in the same session succeed normally.\n- **C4 (Published outputSchema honoured):** **PASS** — Valid calls to read-only tools return `structuredContent` matching their defined schemas.\n- **C5 (Serialisation integrity):** **PASS** — All outputs parse cleanly as JSON with matching textual and structured content.\n- **C6 (Surface lock \u0026 version drift):** **FAIL** — No committed surface lock exists in the repository, and the server is not yet listed in the registry.\n- **C7 (Logging):** **PASS** — Single-point structured JSON logging per call (with latency, method, tool, ok, who) writes to stderr.\n- **C8 (Tool count and naming):** **PASS** — All 3 tool names comply with `^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,64}$`.\n- **C9 (Version negotiation):** **PASS** — Passing `\"protocolVersion\": \"banana\"` does not echo back; the server answers with its implemented version `\"2025-06-18\"`.\n- **C10 (outputSchema constraint testing):** **FAIL** — `search_notes` publishes an unconstrained `{\"type\": \"object\"}` which accepts corrupted payloads without rejecting them.\n\nDetails, exact evidence snippets, and links to the relevant fix stories are available in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-Zq6b6Z/ANSWER.md).\n","duration_seconds":112.199032,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":100960,"output_tokens":5331,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":422793,"total_tokens":106291}}}
